      en: ["El Progreso was officially established as a municipality on October 19, 1892.", "The city is located approximately 20 kilometers east of San Pedro Sula.", "The Ulúa River is the most voluminous river in Honduras.", "The annual city festival, Feria Progreseña, takes place in September.", "El Progreso is the third-largest city in Honduras by population.", "The Mico Quemado mountains border the city to the east."],
