      en: ["Height of the waterfall: 43 meters", "Location: Near San Buenaventura in the Cortés department", "Fed by the waters of the Río Lindo", "Archaeological remains date back to 600-900 AD", "One of the largest and most visited waterfalls in Central America", "Popular filming location for music videos and local movies"],
