      en: ["Year of establishment: 2001", "Focuses on the Scarlet Macaw (Ara macao), the national bird", "Home to over 330 birds of more than 30 different species", "Successfully released over 75 macaws into the Copán Valley", "Works in collaboration with World Parrot Trust and IHAH", "Features an on-site café with local coffee and a small museum"],
